  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2a863d035d7ecb64e8a1c323a530e267, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - 'You can Parry arracks that have a Yellow border,

    This should make you feel
    more arrogant'
  - "You can Jump above attacks that have a Blue color, \nThis should keep you alive"
  - Arrogance leads to Insolence, when you feel insolent your next attack will do
    a massive amount of damage
  - This will make you strong
  - There are more ways to be arrogant, but you may want to talk to the Sparrow Prince
    to learn about those...
